    "mAnswers": {
      "x": 1880,
      "y": 0,
      "w": 520,
      "maxH": 1100,
      "fill": "green",
      "page": "manoj",
      "text": "Manoj's review → where each point is answered\n\n• Q1 asked from user details → screen 06: \"How do you usually get to work in Gurugram?\" (uses profile work/college + city).\n• Show it to logged-out users? → Yes, a teaser on the landing page (01).\n• Can they use it logged out? → No. Tapping asks them to log in first (02), because results are personal and saved. After login they land back on Carbon footprint.\n• Back button on Q1? → Removed. ✕ closes; 'Change' undoes your last answer (05–10).\n• Options instead of text → every question has tap options (07, 09). Typing and voice are optional (08).\n• Discoverable → Home bell + 5 tabs (03), Discover features card (04), Home 'Your impact' card (13), push + email (row 5).\n• Questions not sufficient → 25 questions in 7 topics: Transport, Home energy, Diet, Waste, Water, Flights, Shopping. Follow-ups only when relevant.\n• Mailer + notification → row 5: invite and monthly check-in. Tapping a push opens the right screen.\n• B2B → see the blue note in row 5.\n\nPress Play and tap any screen to go to the next one — all 29 screens are connected and the same size (390 × 844)."
    },
